window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When the world ended, Henry certainly had his hands full keeping his clan alive. </b></p> <p>After all, it's no easy task bringing electricity back to the world, much less raising animals, expanding the farm, and everything in between. Still, given enough time, he could do it all.</p> <p>There's just one problem. An insurgent group has sprung up, and they're determined to kill him and all the other men so they can steal away women for breeding purposes. And that is something Henry cannot abide.</p>"; 
